Package: nda
Type: Package
Title: Generalized Network-Based Dimensionality Reduction and Analysis
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Zsolt T.", "Kosztyan", email="kosztyan.zsolt@gtk.uni-pannon.hu", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Marcell T.", "Kurbucz", email="kurbuczmarcell@gmail.com", role = c("aut")),
    person("Attila I.", "Katona", email="katona.attila@gtk.uni-pannon.hu", role = c("aut")),
    person("Zahid", "Khan", email="zahidkhan@hu.edu.pk", role = c("aut"))
    )
Maintainer: Zsolt T. Kosztyan <kosztyan.zsolt@gtk.uni-pannon.hu>
Description: Constructs interpretable latent variables from communities in
    squared-association networks. Supports full, partial, and semipartial
    associations, feature selection, sparse networks, inference, prediction,
    visualization, and supervised regression. The generalized method is
    described in Kosztyan et al. (2024) <doi:10.1016/j.eswa.2023.121779>.
